{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve containment when every clock sample is interrupted**\n\nUsing the midpoint leaves up to half the sampling window, plus `Date.now()` truncation, as epoch error. The added `[40, 10, 30]` stall case observes a 5 ms offset and skips user-span containment assertions, so scheduler or GC pauses can still place ordinary user spans outside their SDK parents. Retain lower and upper correlation bounds and use start-safe/end-safe boundaries, then assert containment for stalled samples.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs745ih7","finding_digest":"eb83580fb6c6151f56b816d070253ecd2eea42747ad77dfe9353b102e28878f5","finding_id":"arf_v1_5obvqd5wyykr6vvyc3ihajj6zu","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-clock.ts::captureinvocationclock::stalled-sample-containment","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-clock.ts::captureinvocationclock::stalled-sample-containment","line":25,"observation_digest":"71e58b0a6261b98c9cc15e85c2a2156f129749ba4b68d1bc3e2f4876b486b0ef","observation_id":"aro_v1_ohsywctcmg4yzhgbl2c4fiqvn4","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-clock.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_5obvqd5wyykr6vvyc3ihajj6zu","published_at":"2026-10-04T02:28:22Z","review_id":"arr_v1_nzdauapy3tx6o7lq3sjhsccrqa","reviewed_base_sha":"cc7db9bacb23278c58aecf16821737ba47797152","reviewed_head_sha":"061abb44e13feb153ceb9d6267b597b5d142a64e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":25,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":962},"record_id":"art_v1_uoomooz2ntmbbpfnltxxtrkz2f","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-04T02:28:22Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
